: "setup", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\7340fb0f991dbfb8e47715c5.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see it. Usually, do you use the mobile application to check your balances?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\414d7e7be6b2132580081b84.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, almost every day.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\6f4ea9d8596f3618d778f8f3.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. And was your card ever lost or stolen, or did you receive a new one around that time?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\e0d88ae409df0258d81a403a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Worth mentioning: my card was reissued a few weeks ago after a skimming alert.", "kind": "clue", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\ce78df2a9109e7b1cb52c328.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. Were there other unfamiliar amounts on the same statement?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\3af821709820c669f3fcd04f.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, just that single one.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\8aac3edf120b4fe112575459.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Sure. Was the physical card in your possession that day?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\a307ba115d390cd65749581e.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, it was in my wallet the whole time.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\bcd1ba11b66daa7ceefa71a3.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Got it. Is the contact number ending in six-one-eight still yours?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\f7abb13c8e592f5324ed8e4a.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, that number is current.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\e4184e49817e7613bc2052b8.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "I see. Have you shared your card number with any recurring or subscription services?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\e688fe3a98a72ff46be3739f.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Only my usual streaming subscription.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\433e1275fd155ff4de8ef399.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Understood. Did you travel outside your normal area recently?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\a1a0f5a29ee5b8f76cc36ed7.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "No, I have been home all month.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\005f3d4764ea34d450ec1bec.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "Of course. Would you like alerts for every future transaction?", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\b23d4d40f29576875e0e1855.wav", "action_label": null, "response_style_label": null}, {"role": "user", "text": "Yes, please turn those on.", "kind": "filler", "audio_path": "data\\runtime_audio\\gemini3_headline_shard01-of-06\\turns\\37ff6d2697c35ee6b1d66585.wav"}, {"role": "agent", "text": "That's done. I've also updated your account preferences to receive alerts if we find a suspicious transaction. Before we proceed, I'd like to verify your contact information. Is your address still 123 Main Street in Anytown, Illinois?", "audio_path": "data\\